  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.05",
    "summary": "When a [BLAST] weapon's attack dice are collected, it gets one more die per five models the target unit had at the Select Targets step, rounded down; a weapon showing [BLAST X] adds X dice per five models instead. 24.05 sets no engagement limit of its own. Close-Quarters Shooting (10.06) bars a MONSTER or VEHICLE model's [BLAST] attacks against units engaged with the firing unit, and the rules FAQ also rules out [BLAST] weapons against an engaged MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.",
